    "responseBody": "{\"content\":\"\\r\\n    \u003cmeta name\u003d\\\"viewport\\\" content\u003d\\\"width\u003ddevice-width, initial-scale\u003d1.0\\\"\u003e\\r\\n   \\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cdiv class\u003d\\\"topBlock\\\"\u003e\\r\\n\u003carticle\u003e\\r\\n  \\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003c/article\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/div\u003e\\r\\n\u003cdiv class\u003d\\\"mainBlock\\\"\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ccontent\u003e\u003ccontent\u003e\\r\\n\u003ckentico-components-expanding-content data-kentico-content\u003d\\\"true\\\"\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cdiv class\u003d\\\"page-text\\\"\u003e\u003ch1\u003eSports Betting\u0026nbsp;and Online Casino Gaming in Nigeria\u003c/h1\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBetway\u003c/strong\u003e is the leading online\u0026nbsp;betting and casino gaming platform in Nigeria that\u0026#39;s 100% safe and secure. We are committed to providing the best sporting action and many betting opportunities on major leagues and tournaments. Ever since we began, we have grown from strength to strength, showing unwavering commitment to providing quality sports betting entertainment. Over the years we have expanded from just sports bets to offer online casino, Aviator, sports jackpots and so much more.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to sports bets Betway Nigeria provides a wide range of betting odds for sports such as \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/sport/soccer/\\\"\u003efootball\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/sport/cricket/\\\"\u003ecricket\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/sport/rugby-union/\\\"\u003erugby\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/sport/tennis/\\\"\u003etennis\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/sport/basketball\\\"\u003ebasketball\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/sport/baseball\\\"\u003ebaseball\u003c/a\u003e and so much more. Football is one of the most-watched and followed sports in Nigeria. As you watch your favourite team clash with their long-standing rivals, you can show your support by placing a bet.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eYou can bet on every live \u003cstrong\u003ePremier League\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eChampions League\u003c/strong\u003e football match from the comfort of your home or wherever you are using your mobile.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\\\"?register\u003d1\\\"\u003eJoin Betway today\u003c/a\u003e for an incredibly entertaining journey as you experience the love of the game.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ch2\u003ePlacing a Sports bet at Betway is as easy as 1-2-3\u003c/h2\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eBetway gives you the freedom to choose to bet through your mobile device or online. Our website is easy-to-navigate and is designed to make sports betting quick and simple. With a few clicks, \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/how-to-deposit\\\"\u003eyou can make a deposit\u003c/a\u003e, using any of our convenient methods, select the sport you wish to bet on, and win in no time.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eWe give you the option of betting on the games before they start\u0026nbsp;and during the match in the midst of the action, \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/live\\\"\u003eLive Betting\u003c/a\u003e. The latter option allows you to get a first-hand feel of the sporting event, and as the game gains momentum and the odds change, you can make better betting decisions.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eHere are some of the bet types, each with varying odds:\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cul\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eCorrect Score\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eDouble Chance\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eFirst Team to Score\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eBoth Teams to Score\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eOvers/Unders\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eHalftime/Fulltime\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eHalf Time Result\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eCorrect Score\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ch2\u003eVirtual Betting\u003c/h2\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eIf \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/lobby/virtuals\\\"\u003evirtual betting\u003c/a\u003e is more your speed then Betway has some great options for you. You can place bets on virtual football leagues, virtual horseracing, virtual greyhound racing and even virtual camel racing. \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/how-to-register?register\u003d1\\\"\u003eSign up for a Betway account\u003c/a\u003e today and start your virtual betting adventure.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ch2\u003eFantasy\u003c/h2\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eBetway Fantasy sports betting offers sports betting fans an escape from reality where they can bet on multiple fantasy sports leagues. Put your personal dream team together and compete for glory against other fantasy teams. Some of the leagues you can place your fantasy bets on include La Liga, Premier League and UEFA Champions League and that is just the start! \u003ca href\u003d\\\"?register\u003d1\\\"\u003eRegister a Betway account\u003c/a\u003e today and dive into a world of fantasy sports betting adventures.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ch2\u003eBetway Casino\u003c/h2\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eIf you want to take a break from sports betting, you can try any of our colourful \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/lobby/casino\\\"\u003ecasino games\u003c/a\u003e. Betway offers a unique collection of games that are playable on both mobile and your computer. They are specifically optimised for your enjoyment packed with exciting bonus features. The high quality game graphics are themed around popular films and television series, ensuring maximum enjoyment.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eYou can choose between our classic 3-reel fruit slots or our action-packed 5-reel video slots, spin the roulette wheel or take a seat at any of our blackjack tables. We also offer a variety of popular crash games including the much loved \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/aviator\\\"\u003eAviator\u003c/a\u003e that can fly you first class to big wins.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ch2\u003eLive Casino\u003c/h2\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003ePlay the very \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/lobby/livecasino\\\"\u003ebest Live Casino games\u003c/a\u003e in Nigeria from anywhere with Betway. Enjoy the entertainment of playing live roulette, live Blackjack, live Baccarat and live Poker. Betway Live Casino also offers Nigerian players Game Shows and Top Games to choose from. Be dealt hands from a live dealer in real time and play your favorite casino games. You can play from the comfort of your own home or play while you are on the go by using the \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/betway-app\\\"\u003eBetway Mobile App.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\\\"/?register\u003d1\\\"\u003eRegister a Betway account\u003c/a\u003e and start playing Live Casino games today!\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ch2\u003eLucky Numbers\u003c/h2\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eBetway \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/luckynumbers\\\"\u003eLucky Numbers\u003c/a\u003e allow all customers to place bets on the outcomes of a wide range of international betting markets. If you enjoy betting on the outcome of multiple international lottery games then Betway Lucky Numbers is definitely the betting game for you! Bet on the outcomes of international lottery games from all over the world like South Africa, Australia, The United States of America, Italy and many more! \u003ca href\u003d\\\"?register\u003d1 \\\"\u003eRegister a Betway account\u003c/a\u003e today to play Lucky Numbers.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ch2\u003eBetgames\u003c/h2\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\\\"/lobby/betgames\\\"\u003eBetgames\u003c/a\u003e allows you the thrill of betting on live draws that take place at regular intervals right here on the Betway website. All you have to do is select your fixtures, sit back and watch as the live draw takes place. You can bet on a number of live draws including dice throws, wheel of fortune, colours and numbers to name a few.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ch2\u003eEsports\u003c/h2\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\\\"/esports\\\"\u003eEsports betting \u003c/a\u003e fans are also welcome at Betway. We offer a large number of esports to bet on including Fifa, LOL, Dota 2 and Counter-Strike. Whether you\u0026rsquo;ve been a lifelong fan of esports, or have only just found your way into this thrilling new world, there\u0026rsquo;s no doubt that it has a huge following and has taken the world by storm. Betway offers the most competitive odds on a huge variety of esports matches, and you can start betting right away. \u003ca href\u003d\\\"?register\u003d1 \\\"\u003eRegister a Betway account\u003c/a\u003e to start placing your esports bets.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ch2\u003eStandards and Security\u003c/h2\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eBetway Nigeria is licensed by the Lagos State Government of Nigeria (Bookmaker license number 003504) so you can confidently place your bets with total peace of mind. We support responsible gambling and offer a variety of safe and secure payments methods. All transactions are secured using digital encryption technology, the same technology that is used by major financial institutions.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eAre you ready to start betting? \u003ca href\u003d\\\"?register\u003d1\\\"\u003eRegister your Betway account\u003c/a\u003e to get started.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003c/div\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/kentico-components-expanding-content\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/content\u003e\u003c/content\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/div\u003e\\r\\n  \\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\"}",
