    "responseBody": "{\"content\":\"\\r\\n    \u003cmeta name\u003d\\\"viewport\\\" content\u003d\\\"width\u003ddevice-width, initial-scale\u003d1.0\\\"\u003e\\r\\n   \\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cdiv class\u003d\\\"topBlock\\\"\u003e\\r\\n\u003carticle\u003e\\r\\n  \\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003c/article\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/div\u003e\\r\\n\u003cdiv class\u003d\\\"mainBlock\\\"\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ccontent\u003e\u003ccontent\u003e\\r\\n\u003ckentico-components-expanding-content data-kentico-content\u003d\\\"true\\\"\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cdiv class\u003d\\\"page-text\\\"\u003e\u003ch1\u003eBet on table tennis\u003c/h1\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eAt \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/\\\"\u003eBetway\u003c/a\u003e, you can bet on the most popular table tennis tournaments including the ITTF World Tour and Olympic table tennis. In addition to be able to bet before each match, \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/live\\\"\u003eyou can bet live\u003c/a\u003e with a number of exciting and unique betting options. To get started on table tennis, head over to the sports page\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eNew to Betway? \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/how-to-registe?register\u003d1\\\"\u003eRegister an account\u003c/a\u003e today, \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/promotions\\\"\u003eclaim your Welcome Offer\u003c/a\u003e and you\u0026rsquo;ll start betting on table tennis in minutes.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ch2\u003eHow to bet on table tennis\u003c/h2\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003ePlacing a bet on table tennis is quick and easy. To get started, follow our simple step-by-step guide below to place your first bet in minutes. In addition to being able to access Betway from your favourite browser, you can also \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/betway-app\\\"\u003edownload the betway app\u003c/a\u003e and bet on table tennis on-the-go.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003ePlace a bet on table tennis:\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cul\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eOnce you\u0026rsquo;ve logged in, visit the sports page\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eClick the table tennis icon and browse our selection of fixtures\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003ePick your favourite or use the search bar to find something specific\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eOnce you\u0026rsquo;ve placed your bet, complete your betslip and click Bet Now\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eStill not sure how to place a bet on table tennis? Head over to our FAQ page and \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/frequently-asked-questions\\\"\u003etake a look at the answers to our most asked questions\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ch2\u003ePopular table tennis tournaments to bet on\u003c/h2\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eTable tennis offers a wide selection of exciting tournament from around the world to bet on. You can bet on the ITTF World Tour, Olympic table tennis and more. Below, we have complied a few of the most popular table tennis tournaments to be on with a quick outline of what you need to know. If you would like addition assistance, you can \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/contact-us\\\"\u003econtact our 24/7 support centre\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ch3\u003eITTF World Tour\u003c/h3\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eThe ITTF World Tour is an annual set of 12 events that culminate in the ITTF World Tour Grand Finals.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eThe tour is comprised of six World Tour Platinum events and six regular World Tour events. Each event features action in seven categories: Men\u0026#39;s and Women\u0026#39;s Singles, Men\u0026#39;s, Women\u0026#39;s, and Mixed Doubles, and Under-21 Men\u0026#39;s and Women\u0026#39;s Singles. Top players in each category at each event earn points. At the end of the season, the players who have amassed the most points in each of the seven categories progress to the Grand Finals.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eGrand Finals are split into two main formats. The men\u0026rsquo;s and women\u0026rsquo;s singles and doubles events see 15 players qualifying with one wild card being selected by the ITTF. The 16 players are then split into 8 matchups and progress through a knockout stage culminating in the final. The U21 men\u0026rsquo;s and women\u0026rsquo;s events see 8 qualifying players split into two groups of four. The players compete in a round robin format with the top 2 players in each group progressing to a knockout round that culminates in the final.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ch3\u003eTable Tennis at the Olympics\u003c/h3\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eTable tennis was first introduced to the games at the 1988 Summer Olympics in Seoul. It features action in seven categories: men\u0026rsquo;s singles, doubles and team, women\u0026rsquo;s singles, doubles and team, and mixed doubles. Just two competitors for each country are allowed to enter each event, a rule implemented in an attempt to mitigate China\u0026rsquo;s dominance entire podiums.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eUnsurprisingly China is the most dominate country at the Olympics but the extent of their dominance is astonishing. The country has not more double, not triple but close to 10 times the number of gold medals as there next nearest competitor South Korea.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eOnce you\u0026rsquo;ve bet on table tennis, supersize the action and \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/sport/tennis\\\"\u003estart betting on tennis\u003c/a\u003e. We have wide selection of exciting tennis fixtures to bet on from the French Open to Wimbledon and Roland-Garros. To start betting on tennis, head over to the sports page and click on the icon.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eNew to Betway? \u003ca href\u003d\\\"?register\u003d1\\\"\u003eRegister an account\u003c/a\u003e today, claim your Welcome Offer and you\u0026rsquo;ll start betting on table tennis in minutes.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003c/div\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/kentico-components-expanding-content\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/content\u003e\u003c/content\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/div\u003e\\r\\n  \\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\"}",
