    "responseBody": "{\"content\":\"\\r\\n    \u003cmeta name\u003d\\\"viewport\\\" content\u003d\\\"width\u003ddevice-width, initial-scale\u003d1.0\\\"\u003e\\r\\n   \\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cdiv class\u003d\\\"topBlock\\\"\u003e\\r\\n\u003carticle\u003e\\r\\n  \\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003c/article\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/div\u003e\\r\\n\u003cdiv class\u003d\\\"mainBlock\\\"\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ccontent\u003e\u003ccontent\u003e\\r\\n\u003ckentico-components-expanding-content data-kentico-content\u003d\\\"true\\\"\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cdiv class\u003d\\\"page-text\\\"\u003e\u003cdiv class\u003d\\\"seo-wrapper\\\"\u003e\\r\\n\u003cdiv class\u003d\\\"seo-container\\\"\u003e\\r\\n\u003cdiv class\u003d\\\"seo-text-holder\\\"\u003e\\r\\n\u003cdiv class\u003d\\\"seo-section\\\"\u003e\\r\\n\u003ch1\u003eBet on tennis with Betway\u003c/h1\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eAt \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/\\\"\u003eBetway\u003c/a\u003e, you can bet on the biggest tennis tournaments from around the world happening all-year round. Bet on the Australian Open, French Open, Wimbledon and US Open using your mobile. In addition to being able to bet on a tennis match before the game, you can bet on a match \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/live\\\"\u003eLive\u003c/a\u003e as it unfolds.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\\\"/how-to-register?register\u003d1\\\"\u003eRegister an account now\u003c/a\u003e and start betting on tennis.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ch2\u003eHow to deposit into your account\u003c/h2\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eBenefit from Betway\u0026rsquo;s Welcome Bonus when you register and make your first deposit today. Use any of our safe and secure deposit methods to fund your account, these include:\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003col\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eCredit/Debit card\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eDirect Bank Transfer\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eGT Bank\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003