\n\\r\\n\u003cul\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eMatch Result (2 Way)\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eCorrect Score\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eNumber of Sets\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eSet Winner\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eIf you\u0026rsquo;re unsure of what type of bet to place or who to back, \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/stats\\\"\u003evisit our Stats Centre\u003c/a\u003e page to view a full breakdown of every tournament and fixture to help you make a better decision.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\\\"/sport\\\"\u003eVisit our Sports page\u003c/a\u003e today and start betting on various sporting events across the globe including soccer, tennis, basketball and rugby.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ch2\u003ePlay our online casino today\u003c/h2\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eDiscover Nigeria\u0026rsquo;s best online\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\\\"/lobby/casino\\\"\u003eCasino games\u003c/a\u003e in between kick-offs, where you have a choice of endless entertainment at any time of day and wherever you are. You can now enjoy online gaming with complete freedom and with a series of seriously fun casino games on your mobile device or on your desktop computer.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ch2\u003eContact Us\u003c/h2\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eNeed assistance with placing a bet or withdrawing your winnings? \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/contact-us\\\"\u003eContact Betway\u0026rsquo;s support staff\u003c/a\u003e who are available 24/7/365. You can Contact Us via a number of platforms for any queries you need help with.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eYou can contact us on the following platforms:\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cul\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eLive Chat\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eStandard Rate Call: +234 1227 8860\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eAIRTEL Toll Free: 0800 730 300\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eEmail: Support@betway.com.ng\