    "responseBody": "{\"content\":\"\\r\\n    \u003cmeta name\u003d\\\"viewport\\\" content\u003d\\\"width\u003ddevice-width, initial-scale\u003d1.0\\\"\u003e\\r\\n   \\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cdiv class\u003d\\\"topBlock\\\"\u003e\\r\\n\u003carticle\u003e\\r\\n  \\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003c/article\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/div\u003e\\r\\n\u003cdiv class\u003d\\\"mainBlock\\\"\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ccontent\u003e\u003ccontent\u003e\\r\\n\u003ckentico-components-expanding-content data-kentico-content\u003d\\\"true\\\"\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cdiv class\u003d\\\"page-text\\\"\u003e\u003ch1\u003eBet on Basketball with Betway\u003c/h1\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eBasketball has become one of the most beloved sports in the America\u0026rsquo;s with upwards of twenty million viewers tuning into the 2017 NBA Finals. This popularity drives Betway to provide an opportunity for all fans of basketball to back their favourite basketball teams from the NBA, across to the Euro League. Betway\u0026rsquo;s easy to use sports betting platform allows all fans of basketball to bet anywhere anytime, on every quarter and every match. If you are a fan of this high-intensity sport, make sure to \u003ca href\u003d\\\"?register\u003d1\\\"\u003eregister an account\u003c/a\u003e so that you too can bet on all the adrenaline-filled basketball action from across the globe.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ch2\u003eHow to bet on basketball\u003c/h2\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003ePlacing a bet on basketball is quick and simple on Betway\u0026rsquo;s streamlined platform where you can confirm your bets with a single click. If you do not have an account, simply \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/how-to-register?register\u003d1\\\"\u003eregister a new account\u003c/a\u003e and benefit from the Welcome Bonus. Visit our banking page to \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/how-to-deposit\\\"\u003emake your first deposit\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eTo place your bets on basketball, simply:\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003col\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eLog into your Betway account and click on the basketball icon\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eFilter your selections according to region and league on Choose League and filter according to the market on Choose Bet Type\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eClick on your selection and Bet Type, you can either place a single bet or you can combine all your selections into a Multi Bet\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eEnter your bet amount and confirm bet by clicking Bet Now\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/ol\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eYou can bet on pre-game and live basketball games meaning you can place your bets before the game starts and while the action takes place. Betway also offers useful tools such as stats on both teams to help you place a more measured bet. Bet easily from a number of devices including mobile, desktop computer, iPad or you can download the Betway App.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eBetway also offers Early Cash Out on some basketball matches. This is a fantastic betting option that allows you to withdraw your funds before your bet settles. This can be before the game starts or while the game plays out. To learn more about our Early Cash Out feature, visit our \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/cash-out\\\"\u003eEarly Cash Out\u003c/a\u003e page.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eFor more information on the full range of service that Betway offers, make sure to visit the \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/sport/soccer\\\"\u003eSports page\u003c/a\u003e on the Betway website. If you have any questions, make sure to check out the \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/frequently-asked-questions\\\"\u003eFAQ\u0026rsquo;s\u003c/a\u003e, and, if you require further assistance, \u003ca href\u003d\\\"/contact-us\\\"\u003eyou can contact Betway\u003c/a\u003e via the Contact Us page.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ch2\u003eBet Types offered on basketball\u003c/h2\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eBetway offers a wide variety of different markets that fans can choose to bet on when eyeing out the latest basketball fixtures. The various Bet Types on offer for customers include the following:\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003col\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eMatch Result\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eMatch Result (Inc. OT)\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eOvers/Unders\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/ol\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eIn the modern age, the NBA is the most popular league in the world and boasts some of the greatest players to grace the sport. These include Shaquille O\u0026rsquo;Neil, Michael Jordan, Kobe Bryant and LeBron James. In each season, a packed schedule sees teams play 82 games split the regular and post season. This gives you ample time to place long-term bets such as Outright Winner, Conference Winner and much more. Each basketball team fields 5 starting players on the court and the main aim is to outscore your opponent by attacking their basket and scoring points. Points are tallied according to the distance in which the ball is scored.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003col\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eHandicap (1X2)\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eHighest Scoring Quarter\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\\t\u003cli\u003eDraw No Bet\u003c/li\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/ol\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eThese Bet Types are available on both pre-game and live betting. To view all the basketball games you can bet on live, simply click on the basketball icon and click Live Now to view the list of fixtures available.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy bet on basketball?\u003c/h2\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003cp\u003eIn the NBA there are certain teams that you will want to keep track of if you are planning to bet on basketball. The Philadelphia 76ers have stunned crowds in recent times rising from a somewhat underwhelming squad to one that excites with stunning wins. Other fantastic teams to watch and bet on include the Boston Celtics, the Houston Rockets and of course, The Golden State Warriors. Currently, the Golden State Warriors are the team to beat, having established a dynasty of fantastic basketball over the past 5 years. They faced the Cleveland Cavaliers in the last 3 NBA Finals and in 2018, they swept them in four games becoming the ninth team to ever accomplish such a feat.\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\u003c/div\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/kentico-components-expanding-content\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/content\u003e\u003c/content\u003e\\r\\n\u003c/div\u003e\\r\\n  \\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\"}",
